  "description": "Preflight and launch the trainer block in the current working directory. Runs /trainer:check internally (rejects on any failure), shows the run configuration and waits for explicit confirmation, then launches scripts/start.sh — which runs dryrun.sh, then train.sh (obtain/convert LF data, dataset registration, LLaMA-Factory + DeepSpeed ZeRO-3 training on 8× GPU, WandB tracking), and on exit archives the run via scripts/archive_run.sh. Background by default — training is long-running. train.sh itself writes runtime_info.output; archive_run.sh appends to artifacts/index.yaml. Triggers on phrases like \"run trainer\", \"launch trainer training\", \"start the trainer block\", \"kick off the supervised fine-tuning\", \"fire off trainer\".",
